    "details": "<p><strong>There will be three rounds:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prelims 1: Online round on HackerEarth open to all.</li>\n<li>Prelims 2: Online round on HackerEarth open to all.</li>\n<li>Finals: Selected students from prelims will compete in an offline round at IITM!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note: Both prelims are independent, and we will select the best participants from both prelims. Those who qualify from Prelim 1 need not participate in Prelim 2.</p>\n<p><strong>The event comprises coding challenges across 3 categories:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Competitive Programming</li>\n<li>Code Golfing</li>\n<li>Debugging</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines for Prelims:<br /></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must submit solutions within the time limit - This will be announced.</li>\n<li>Use of external code, AI tools, or collaboration with others is strictly prohibited<strong>.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
